{"ticker":"TECH","updated":"2026-10-24T00:15:46Z","profile":{"longName":"Bio-Techne Corporation","shortName":"Bio-Techne Corp","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bio-techne.com","fullTimeEmployees":3000,"marketCap":11377164288,"trailingPE":62.543106,"forwardPE":31.371887,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.363621,"pegRatio":2.11,"targetMeanPrice":70.5,"targetHighPrice":73.0,"targetLowPrice":50.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.013,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.66243,"operatingMargins":0.27871,"profitMargins":0.14968,"totalRevenue":1215038976,"beta":1.295,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":72.69,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":43.2,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.44},"summary":"Bio-Techne Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and sells life science reagents, instruments, and services for the research, diagnostics, and bioprocessing markets worldwide. It operates through two segments, Protein Sciences, and Diagnostics and Spatial Biology. The Protein Sciences segment develops and manufactures biological reagents used in various aspects of life science research, diagnostics, and cell and gene therapy, such as cytokines and growth factors, antibodies, small molecules, tissue culture sera, and cell selection technologies. This segment also offers proteomic analytical tools for automated western blot and multiplexed ELISA workflow consists of manual and automated protein analysis instruments and immunoassays for use in quantifying proteins in various biological fluids. Its Diagnostics and Genomics segment develops and manufactures diagnostic products, including controls, calibrators, and diagnostic assays for regulated diagnostics market, advanced tissue-based in-situ hybridization assays for spatial genomic and tissue biopsy analysis, and genetic and oncology kits for research and clinical applications; and sells products for genetic carrier screening, oncology diagnostics, molecular controls, and research, as well as instruments and process control products for hematology, blood chemistry and gases, and coagulation controls","summary_zh":"Bio-Techne Corporation 及其子公司為全球研究、診斷和生物加工市場開發、製造和銷售生命科學試劑、儀器和服務。它透過兩個部門運作：蛋白質科學以及診斷和太空生物學。蛋白質科學部門開發和製造用於生命科學研究、診斷以及細胞和基因療法各個方面的生物試劑，例如細胞激素和生長因子、抗體、小分子、組織培養血清和細胞選擇技術。該部門還提供用於自動蛋白質印跡和多重 ELISA 工作流程的蛋白質組分析工具，包括手動和自動蛋白質分析儀器以及用於定量各種生物液體中蛋白質的免疫測定。其診斷和基因組部門開發和製造診斷產品，包括用於受監管診斷市場的對照品、校準品和診斷測定，用於空間基因組和組織活檢分析的先進的基於組織的原位雜交測定，以及用於研究和臨床應用的遺傳和腫瘤學試劑盒；銷售用於遺傳載體篩檢、腫瘤診斷、分子控制和研究的產品，以及用於血液凝血、化學和氣體過程以及用於血液學、化學和氣體的儀器","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"生物技術","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":56.86,"h":56.94,"l":55.77,"c":56.71,"v":2317300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":56.64,"h":57.6,"l":56.11,"c":56.79,"v":1870500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":56.88,"h":57.37,"l":56.02,"c":56.22,"v":1813900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":56.23,"h":56.6,"l":52.93,"c":54.33,"v":4028800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":54.15,"h":55.25,"l":54.09,"c":54.63,"v":1720800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":54.17,"h":54.38,"l":52.31,"c":53.42,"v":1738900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":53.6,"h":54.04,"l":52.81,"c":53.34,"v":2340600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":53.19,"h":53.19,"l":51.62,"c":52.92,"v":2402200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":53.04,"h":54.48,"l":52.77,"c":54.41,"v":1745300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":54.05,"h":54.33,"l":53.29,"c":54.11,"v":2427800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":54.19,"h":54.54,"l":53.49,"c":54.2,"v":2229700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":53.9,"h":54.62,"l":50.87,"c":50.96,"v":3130200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":51.02,"h":53.4,"l":50.98,"c":53.21,"v":1846500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":52.96,"h":52.96,"l":50.76,"c":51.26,"v":1982100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":51.52,"h":51.87,"l":51.02,"c":51.62,"v":2006200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":51.52,"h":52.2,"l":50.96,"c":51.78,"v":3987600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":51.84,"h":53.75,"l":51.1,"c":51.52,"v":1819900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":52.03,"h":53.26,"l":51.8,"c":52.99,"v":1647100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":53.24,"h":53.43,"l":51.96,"c":53.15,"